Anya P: FYI PR #4410 touches SDK snippets across py/ts/go. Streaming iterator was changed and pagination tokens were renamed. Can docs update minimal examples + a 1-line migration note?
Sam W: I'll do Go. Swap Chunks() loop to StreamIter.
Mike L: Python + small retry helper (exponential backoff, capped). Will keep snippet tiny.
Nina K: TS samples + imports. Will check links/anchors.
Jules R (docs-bot): CI: linkcheck failed -> /docs/streams-legacy.md 404.
Anya P: Replace with /docs/streams.md and mention new pagination field next_page_token. Add mapping: page -> page_token, per_page -> page_size.
Sam W: Go snippet:```go
// old
resp, _ := client.Stream(ctx, req)
for c := range resp.Chunks() { fmt.Println(c.Text) }

// new
it := client.StreamIter(ctx, req)
for it.Next() { fmt.Println(it.Value().Text) }
```
Mike L: Python snippet:```py
# tiny retry + iterator
from time import sleep

def retry(fn, tries=3):
  for i in range(tries):
    try: return fn()
    except TransientError:
      sleep(min(2**i, 5))
  raise

with client.stream_iter(prompt) as it:
  for chunk in it:
    print(chunk.text)
```
Nina K: TS snippet:```ts
// new async iterator
for await (const chunk of client.streamIter(req)) {
  console.log(chunk.text)
}
```
Anya P: Add one-line: "Do not retry on 4xx errors; prefer short capped exponential backoff for transient 5xx/timeouts."
Jules R (docs-bot): Deploy preview: https://deploy-preview-4410--docs.redwood.ai (linkcheck now passes).
Anya P: Thanks team, merging in ~45m if green.
